        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LEONARD WILSON KEENAN \r\nThe Leinster Property Specialists….\r\n\r\nMOST UNIQUE 4 BED / 2 BATH DETACHED HOME ON LARGE END SITE WITH SUNROOM & LARGE CONVERTED ATTIC \r\nIDYLLIC CUL DE SAC POSITION \r\nEXTRA LARGE BACK GARDEN WITH A SOUTH EASTERLY ORIENTATION \r\nEXQUISITE INTERIOR \r\nADJACENT TO BEAUTIFUL GREEN\r\n\r\nA most captivating home in an idyllic setting….\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Patrick Leonard The Leinster Property Specialists are truly delighted to present this stunning home to the Laois Property Market. \r\n\r\nThis is a most imposing detached home which must be viewed to be fully appreciated. \r\n\r\nThe extra spacious most deceptive floor plan consists of: Hallway, living room, kitchen / dining room, sunroom, utility room, 4 double bedrooms to include primary en suite and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe first floor consists of a large converted attic which could easily be converted into 2 large bedrooms and bathroom.\r\n\r\nIf you are looking for a large family home on the edge of a lovely village - then look no further. \r\n\r\nPortlaoise, Roscrea & Kilkenny are all within close proximity offering a wealth of local amenities together with an abundance of retail and leisure options. The M7 Motorway is within a few minutes. Both Cork & Dublin can be reached in 90 minutes making this a most strategically positioned home.\r\n\r\nThe many features of this exquisite home include: Quality flooring throughout, feature fireplace in living room, solid timber fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage to include all integrated appliances, quality covings throughout & upgraded sanitary ware and tiling in the main family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property is a most energy efficient home with double glazed windows and oil fired central heating. \r\n\r\nOutside there is a lawned garden and driveway to the front together with side entrance on either side. To the rear is a large garden with a south easterly orientation.\r\n\r\nThe property also falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families.\r\n\r\nThe area is serviced by an excellent bus service with excellent connectivity to Dublin. The M7 is also within close proximity making this a most strategic location. \r\nThere are train services from Ballybrophy which is only a few minutes away.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. \r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
